  "decision": "Held the $5K estimate at 61% and the $10K estimate at 31%, with catalyst scores and colors unchanged. ETH's rebound to about $2.65K, rising DeFi TVL, positive bridge flows, and 43.36M ETH staked are constructive but remain continuation evidence rather than a new regime. The latest finalized ETF session is still September 18, so institutional demand cannot yet be upgraded. Roughly even odds of another Fed hike, high front-end yields, and a firm dollar keep cyclical liquidity at the floor; this remains separate from the unchanged structural fiscal-debasement case. L1 chain revenue fell to about $44K versus $5.29M of application fees, preserving the explicit ETH value-capture penalty for $10K. No catalyst crossed a color threshold, neither probability moved, and no thesis-breaking event occurred."
